        "## 9. The ML Engine\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the part the mobile app calls. A volunteer enters their skills, availability and location, and the engine:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Checks the input.** Empty skills, skills it does not recognise, or an availability or location outside the valid options are rejected with a clear message instead of a wrong answer.\n",
        "2. **Predicts.** It returns the top 3 cause areas, each with a confidence percentage.\n",
        "3. **Explains.** For each cause it lists the inputs that pushed the score up the most. In Logistic Regression each skill has a weight for each cause, so the reasons are the skills and options with the biggest weight times their value for this volunteer. This is the explainable AI part of the app."
      ],
