        "## 10. Conclusion and Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "The engine takes a volunteer's skills, availability and location, checks the input, and returns the top 3 cause areas with a confidence score and the reasons behind each one.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final model got 85.7% on volunteers it had not seen, compared with 16.7% for guessing.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Limitations:**\n",
        "- The dataset is synthetic (420 volunteers made up to look like Nairobi volunteers). The accuracy shows the model learned the pattern in this data, not that it will do as well on real volunteers.\n",
        "- Skills drive most of the predictions. Availability and location add very little.\n",
        "- The model can only recommend the six cause areas in the data.\n",
